<title>USA: Food Lion sees few Kash n' Karry closings.</title>
<headline>Food Lion sees few Kash n' Karry closings.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food Lion Inc said on Thursday only a few Kash n' Karry stores would be closed after it acquires the company.</p>
<p>In a telephone conference call, company executives said that &quot;a few&quot; stores would be closed due to size constraints or changing demographics.</p>
<p>The company said it plans to invest up to $150 million to remodel and upgrade Kash n' Karrry stores in the first four years following completion of the transaction.</p>
</text>
